**Title:** Whispering Waves: A Grateful Journey with Miles

**Description:** Drift into a serene slumber with the gentle tale of Miles, an 11-year-old boy whose heart overflows with gratitude and wonder. Accompanied by his playful raccoon friend, Bandit, Miles explores the tranquil beauty of a coastal shoreline at twilight. As the soothing sound of waves and the soft glow of stars guide them, Miles discovers the simple joys that nature offers—a reminder of the gratitude found in life's quiet moments. This sleep story, woven with calming imagery and tender companionship, is designed to ease anxiety and foster an emotional calm, wrapping listeners in the peaceful embrace of the night.

**Keywords:** sleep, relaxation, bedtime story, coastal, shoreline, Miles, raccoon, Bandit, gratitude, nature, ocean, tranquility, anxiety relief, emotional calm, peaceful sleep

